n('selberg-freeze-sandbox','open-lemma','Selberg zeta freeze sandbox lacks an RH-false control','On the PSL2(Z) Selberg zeta (3,784,618 primitive classes; Euler product vs Mayer determinant 6.1e-9) Theorem U, telescope and five-shell hold verbatim; sigma = 0.55 phase gate Re Z < 0 on 6.1% vs 0% for zeta. Not run: an RH-true / RH-false Selberg pair (cocompact vs exceptional eigenvalue).','measured','yes','unknown',PA+'route28-selberg-freeze-sandbox; src/data/route-28-selberg-zeta-freeze-sandbox-2026-10-12.js',['trace-formula','euler-product','twin-ladder'])
n('visibility-gauge','obstruction','Interferometer visibility is vacuous, false or a gauge','V0 = 2|chi|/(1+|chi|^2) = sech(log|chi|) depends on the gamma factor alone. On the theta split Lambda = A(s) + A(1-s), sup V < 1 would suffice, but Arb certifies V = 1 fringes on every tested line to t = 200 for zeta and DH. Obstruction map G1/G8.','certified','no','yes',PA+'route29-visibility-functional',['bridge','theta','visualization'])
n('phase-retrieval-zeta','identity','Phase retrieval: |zeta| on one line fixes zeta up to off-line flips','G = e^{i alpha + lambda(s - 1/2)} xi prod_S B~_rho(s)/B~_rho(1/2) (9 configurations per off-line quadruple). FE + reality force +-xi. Two lines (Poisson-Jensen) locate every zero with beta > 1/2 without the FE (DH: 8 off-line zeros below 400). Hilbert phase defect on the line <~ 1.48e-12 t.','proved','no','yes',PA+'route48-phase-retrieval; src/data/route-48-phase-retrieval-zeta-2026-10-15.js',['bridge','pick','zero-channel'])
