n('effective-kkl-threshold','identity','Explicit Ki-Kim-Lee threshold x0(t) about 4 pi exp(c/t)','For t in [t_lo, 1/2], zeros of H_t with Re z >= x0(t_lo) + 0.47 are real and simple: x0 = 4.065e13 (t >= 0.20), 1.502e17 (0.15), 1.461e24 (0.10); c about 5.3-5.8. Conditional on Polymath15 Theorem 1.3. Feeds only the canopy hypothesis, replaces no verified height.','certified','no','no',PA+'route20-effective-kkl',['heat-flow','lambda'])
